title: '`pallet-staking-async`: Only move spendable funds out of expired era pots'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    When an era expires, its reward pot now only sends its spendable balance to
    `UnclaimedRewardHandler`. Locked funds stay in the pot.
crates:
- name: pallet-staking-async
  bump: patch
